{"id":"vod_jy_111927","vodId":"111927","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"麻辣教师 GTO","name_cn":"麻辣教师 GTO","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第43集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/1d5fc80a4567e1a0f131c121004009a2.jpg"},"summary":"中学时代，暴走族鬼冢英吉和弹间龙二组成的“鬼爆二人组”曾经声名显赫，机车、拳头、鲜血、爱情、友情，构成了他们多彩而起伏的青春。随着年龄增长，青春孟浪的少年也逐渐归于沉寂。龙二和女友小渚合理经营机车修理店，平凡而幸福；英吉则进入一所九流大学混日子，色心高涨的他为了能勾搭高校女生，竟然打算当老师！\n　　阴差阳错，英吉在训导主任内山田以及理事长的帮助下，成功进入高中执教。在这个问题多多的高中里，英吉不仅要面对性格别扭、怪招不断的学生们，还要时刻提防教师间的倾轧。他这样一个格格不入的家伙，能否在这表面祥和的泥潭中","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-01 17:14:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":43,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e739p2je/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2Q8rma/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bmZqYgOd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dR6lPDqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e1w6GPRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dBBrPjXd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dL9Zvwwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e316ymQb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/e9r9Dv3a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dPNjzEwa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/azp67zYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/egJpn9Yd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/dJ68Nx2d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bkR2rL5a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bo2Zjgja/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/av2Q86ra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/bYE7ymKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集